><surname>Shay</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Limited Wegener's granulomatosis &#x02013; is it limited?</article-title><source>Clin Rheumatol</source><year>2007</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>1999</fpage><lpage>2000</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17401514</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s10067-007-0612-3</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>